{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/extras/SteamPageGifSlow.gif?t=1751465666\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build the Perfect Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each party member has different abilities, synergies and choices in events </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, draft carefully: because without knowing how to scale your team to victory, you'll end up as a yummy snack for the bigger threats which lurk further within the woods...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/extras/BuffGif.gif?t=1751465666\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple mechanics combine into satisfying and deep game design, perfectly scratching that itch of watching numbers grow while your party powers up throughout their adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/extras/HaT_HeroSleeping200.gif?t=1751465666\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play At Your Own Pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Runs can be as quick and snappy as you wish once you get used to the game (about 10 minutes long for veteran players), the game turn-based nature of the game also lets you choose to take your time and make the perfect decision\u2014or read carefully and savor the writing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/extras/TileShuffleGif.gif?t=1751465666\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Map Navigation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prioritize the right tiles for your team's needs\u00a0while watching out for the creeping fog, which affects each step you take throughout the randomized map... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clever decision-making and capitalizing on opportunities can make (or break!) your run.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667720?t=1751465666","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/106fdac96484d6c40616cbe4083906fa88070fa9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751465666","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/6f3ce66528b7b5b83548f7a3f40822e8f1088526/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751465666","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/6f3ce66528b7b5b83548f7a3f40822e8f1088526/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751465666","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3745660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/extras/SteamPageGifSlow.gif?t=1751465666\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build the Perfect Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each party member has different abilities, synergies and choices in events </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, draft carefully: because without knowing how to scale your team to victory, you'll end up as a yummy snack for the bigger threats which lurk further within the woods...</p><p cl